From a privacy perspective, the key priority is to emphasise the integration and the new service available in Bolt, rather than focusing on the third party (Forest e-Bikes) itself. This approach will help us avoid being classified as promoting a "Third Party" and allow us to utilise the soft opt-in strategy.

I believe that using third-party branding and images could increase this risk, so we need to be cautious and smart about using 3P brand to avoid confusion for our users. I look forward to reviewing the specific communications once you have them finalised.

